Rāma asks where Sītā his life support is --- Rāma says he cannot live moment without Sītā --- Rāma fears Kaikēyī triumphs and Kausalyā suffers --- Rāma blames trick voice for frightening Lakṣmaṇa --- Rāma says demons avenge Khara through Sītā --- Rāma reproaches Lakṣmaṇa while hurrying back --- Rāma enters hermitage and finds dwelling empty